---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Services" description="Small business website design, website refreshes, content updates, landing pages, ongoing website support, and practical website management from HEX Design Labs.">
	<main class="page">
		<section class="page-hero">
			<p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
			<h1>Website help for small businesses that need a clearer, easier-to-manage site.</h1>
			<p class="lead">
				HEX helps small businesses plan new websites, refresh outdated pages, improve website copy, and keep their online presence maintained without adding another chore to the week. Services are intentionally practical, with room for design, content, updates, and support depending on what the business needs most.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="section two-column">
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow">Website Support</p>
				<h2>For owners who know their website needs attention, but do not need a complicated process.</h2>
			</div>
			<div>
				<p>
					Small business website work can mean a lot of different things: building a new site, improving an older one, cleaning up confusing pages, adding service information, updating images, or making the contact path easier to find. HEX keeps the work focused on practical website design and website management needs, without promising specific outcomes or forcing a one-size-fits-all package.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="section">
			<div class="grid">
				<article class="card">
					<h3>Website Design</h3>
					<p>Small business website design with clear structure, responsive layouts, brand-aligned visuals, service information, and customer paths that are easy to follow.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="card">
					<h3>Website Refreshes</h3>
					<p>Website refresh support for existing sites that need cleaner messaging, updated visuals, better page flow, revised content, or a more current first impression.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="card">
					<h3>Website Management</h3>
					<p>Ongoing website management for businesses that want help with content changes, updates, maintenance, routine checks, and small improvements after launch.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="card">
					<h3>Landing Pages</h3>
					<p>Focused website pages for services, promotions, local campaigns, announcements, or new offers that need a clear place to send customers.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="card">
					<h3>Content Support</h3>
					<p>Website copy support for page planning, service descriptions, messaging cleanup, headings, calls to action, and clearer customer communication.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="card">
					<h3>Marketing Design</h3>
					<p>Digital graphics and supporting materials that keep your website, campaigns, social posts, and customer touchpoints feeling more aligned.</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="cta-band">
			<h2>Have a website project in mind?</h2>
			<p>Send over what you are trying to fix, improve, or finally get online. HEX can help shape a sensible next step for website design, a website refresh, or ongoing website support.</p>
			<a href="/contact" class="button">Request Website Help</a>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
